{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>加拿大開出史上最高彩票頭獎，一注獨中折合約5億港元獎金。</p><p></p><p>加拿大Lotto Max頭獎連續多期無人中獎，獎金累積至9,000萬加元，創下當地最高獎金紀錄，到了當地周二晚攪珠，一注獨中。中獎彩票在艾伯塔省售出，當地有官員指，幸運兒來自卡爾加里區，不排除是數人夾錢投注，暫時未知其身份。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CAN.LOTTO-0800_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026rsSZPOkuuv1792632029.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>Lotto Max頭獎金額本來最多8,000萬加元，派獎單位今年修改規則，提高至9,000萬加元。去年安大略省兩名好友共同贏得8,040萬加元，是當時加拿大已領取最高派彩。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T02:01:37.768817+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":228,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:58:04.768913+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T01:57:50.018613+00:00","content_hash":"6bea2350a8033847c0e046d902df583b5c139f61eb6bf46ff44932119639d036","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}